OL,3,GNEWSAWindmill's sails to be removed due
OL,4,Ato damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II-listed windmill is set to
OL,7,Fhave its wooden sails removed due to
OL,8,Fstructural concerns.
OL,10,FWhitburn Windmill has been fenced off
OL,11,Ffor months after a storm damaged it in
OL,12,Fwinter, causing some of the wood to
OL,13,Fcome loose.
OL,15,FSouth Tyneside Council said the sails
OL,16,Fwill be removed in October and its
OL,17,F"immediate priority" was to "make the
OL,18,Fstructure safe".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
