OL,3,GNEWSAWindmill's sails to be removed due
OL,4,Ato damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no timescale for when the
OL,7,Fsails will be restored but residents
OL,8,Fare campaigning to secure funding to
OL,9,Fallow this to happen as soon as
OL,10,Fpossible.
